---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'China Visa-Free Countries List (2026) — China Starter Guide';
const description = 'Official list of countries eligible for visa-free entry to China — unilateral (50 countries) and mutual agreements (29 countries).';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/en/prepare/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Prepare
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">📋 Entry & Visa</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        China Visa-Free Countries List (2026)
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">Check if your country qualifies for visa-free entry to China.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 Last updated: June 2026</span>
        <span>⏱️ 5 min read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 Quick Answer</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>There are two ways to enter China visa-free:</strong> China offers unilateral visa-free entry to citizens of <strong>50 countries</strong> (up to 30 days), and has mutual visa-free agreements with <strong>29 countries</strong>. If your country isn't on either list, check the 240-hour transit policy or apply for an L visa.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Below are the complete lists based on the latest official data from the Chinese government (2025). Source: <a href="http://big5.www.gov.cn/gate/big5/www.gov.cn/yaowen/liebiao/202508/content_7035244.htm" class="text-brand-600 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中国政府网</a>.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <!-- Section 1: Unilateral -->
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🟢</span> Unilateral Visa-Free (50 Countries)
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Citizens of these countries can enter China <strong>without a visa</strong> for up to <strong>30 days</strong>. No advance application needed.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 font-medium">Valid for: Tourism, business, family visits, transit, cultural exchanges. Max 30 days.</p>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Europe (35)</h3>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <span>France</span><span>Germany</span><span>Italy</span>
          <span>Netherlands</span><span>Spain</span><span>Switzerland</span>
          <span>Ireland</span><span>Hungary</span><span>Austria</span>
          <span>Belgium</span><span>Luxembourg</span><span>Poland</span>
          <span>Portugal</span><span>Greece</span><span>Cyprus</span>
          <span>Slovenia</span><span>Slovakia</span><span>Norway</span>
          <span>Finland</span><span>Denmark</span><span>Iceland</span>
          <span>Andorra</span><span>Monaco</span><span>Liechtenstein</span>
          <span>Bulgaria</span><span>Romania</span><span>Croatia</span>
          <span>Montenegro</span><span>North Macedonia</span><span>Malta</span>
          <span>Estonia</span><span>Latvia</span><span>Russia</span>
          <span>Sweden</span><span>United Kingdom</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Asia (7)</h3>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <span>Brunei</span><span>South Korea</span><span>Japan</span>
          <span>Saudi Arabia</span><span>Oman</span><span>Kuwait</span>
          <span>Bahrain</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Americas (6)</h3>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <span>Brazil</span><span>Argentina</span><span>Chile</span>
          <span>Peru</span><span>Uruguay</span><span>Canada</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Oceania (2)</h3>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <span>Australia</span><span>New Zealand</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <!-- Section 2: Mutual -->
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🔵</span> Mutual Visa-Free Agreements (29 Countries)
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        China has signed mutual visa-exemption agreements with these countries. Citizens holding ordinary passports can enter China visa-free for short stays.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <span>Albania</span><span>UAE</span><span>Antigua and Barbuda</span>
          <span>Barbados</span><span>Bahamas</span><span>Belarus</span>
          <span>Bosnia and Herzegovina</span><span>Dominica</span><span>Ecuador</span>
          <span>Fiji</span><span>Grenada</span><span>Georgia</span>
          <span>Kazakhstan</span><span>Qatar</span><span>Maldives</span>
          <span>Mauritius</span><span>Samoa</span><span>Serbia</span>
          <span>Seychelles</span><span>San Marino</span><span>Suriname</span>
          <span>Solomon Islands</span><span>Thailand</span><span>Tonga</span>
          <span>Uzbekistan</span><span>Singapore</span><span>Armenia</span>
          <span>Azerbaijan</span><span>Malaysia</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">Note: Check your specific passport type and allowed duration before traveling, as terms vary by agreement.</p>
      <a href="/en/visa/mutual-agreement/" class="inline-block text-sm font-medium text-teal-700 underline hover:no-underline">Detailed mutual agreement guide →</a>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <!-- Section 3: Transit -->
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🟡</span> 240-Hour Visa-Free Transit (55 Countries)
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        If your country isn't in either visa-free list above, you may still qualify for the <strong>240-hour (10-day) transit</strong> policy. This allows you to stay in specific cities/regions for up to 10 days without a visa.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <span>Austria</span><span>Belgium</span><span>Czech Republic</span>
          <span>Denmark</span><span>Estonia</span><span>Finland</span>
          <span>France</span><span>Germany</span><span>Greece</span>
          <span>Hungary</span><span>Iceland</span><span>Italy</span>
          <span>Latvia</span><span>Lithuania</span><span>Luxembourg</span>
          <span>Malta</span><span>Netherlands</span><span>Poland</span>
          <span>Portugal</span><span>Slovakia</span><span>Slovenia</span>
          <span>Spain</span><span>Sweden</span><span>Switzerland</span>
          <span>Monaco</span><span>Russia</span><span>United Kingdom</span>
          <span>Ireland</span><span>Cyprus</span><span>Bulgaria</span>
          <span>Romania</span><span>Ukraine</span><span>Serbia</span>
          <span>Croatia</span><span>Bosnia and Herzegovina</span>
          <span>Montenegro</span><span>North Macedonia</span>
          <span>Albania</span><span>Belarus</span><span>Norway</span>
          <span>United States</span><span>Canada</span><span>Brazil</span>
          <span>Mexico</span><span>Argentina</span><span>Chile</span>
          <span>Australia</span><span>New Zealand</span><span>South Korea</span>
          <span>Japan</span><span>Singapore</span><span>Brunei</span>
          <span>UAE</span><span>Qatar</span><span>Indonesia</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">Note: Only valid for transit through specific ports. You must have a confirmed onward ticket.</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">❓</span> Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">How long can I stay visa-free?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Up to 30 calendar days per entry for unilateral visa-free countries. For mutual agreement countries, check your specific agreement terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Can I work or study visa-free?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">No. Visa-free entry is for tourism, business visits, family visits, and short-term cultural exchanges only. Work and study require the appropriate visa.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">What if my country isn't on any list?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">You'll need to apply for a standard L-type Tourist Visa before traveling.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📚 Sources</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://en.nia.gov.cn/n147418/n147463/c183390/content.html" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">National Immigration Administration — List of Countries Covered by Unilateral Visa Exemption</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.gov.cn/yaowen/liebiao/202508/content_7035244.htm" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gov.cn — Which countries can visit China visa-free? A comprehensive list!</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://cs.mfa.gov.cn/wgrlh/lhqz/lhqzjjs/202510/t20251023_11739051.shtml" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ministry of Foreign Affairs — Mutual Visa Exemption Agreements</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 Related Guides</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/en/visa/visa-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">China Visa Types Complete Guide</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">All visa options explained</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/visa/transit-240/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">240-Hour Visa-Free Transit Explained</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">10-day transit without a visa</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>